# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Art assets — code only in this repo; bring your own art.
#
# content/tiles/ATTRIBUTION.md is explicit that the sample pack shipped with no
# license file and must not be committed until its terms are confirmed. Keeping
# art out is a licensing requirement, not a preference.
#
# Everything below is either that art or regenerable from it:
#   tiles/        source art
#   *.png         atlas and per-tile sprite images placed in tilesets/
#   *.tsj         tileset definitions that accompany the art
#   catalog.json  asset records describing the art
#
# Hand-authored .tsx tileset definitions ARE tracked: they are metadata, not
# pixels, and they are what a new pack needs in order to import at all.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
content/tiles/
content/tilesets/*.png
content/tilesets/*.tsj
content/tilesets/*.lock.json
content/assets/catalog.json

# Purchased art packs unzipped in place (LimeZu Modern Exteriors, RPG Maker MV
# export). Licensed per-buyer, ~350MB, and redistribution is not granted — the
# importer reads them from here, but they must never be committed.
tools/map-mcp/modernexteriors-win/
tools/map-mcp/Modern_Exteriors_RPG_Maker_MV/
tools/map-mcp/packs/

# Everything the LimeZu importer generates is derived from that art.
content/assets/limezu-*.json
